cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and please also cite the Penn 3T-7T dataset."
title: "Epileptogenic-zone localization from MRI with iEEG-derived labels"
abstract: >-
  A 3D convolutional neural network that learns seizure-onset locations from intracranial EEG
  (labels from an onset detector chosen on an expert-annotated benchmark) and predicts a probability
  map, the hemisphere and ranked brain regions from a FreeSurfer-processed T1 MRI. Trained and tested
  on the public Penn 3T-7T Paired Epilepsy Imaging dataset. Research prototype, not a clinical tool.
